A '''Baliscan passport''' ({{lang-bl|Passaport baliscana}}; {{lang-kp|Anhangá Okẽndavoka}}; {{Lang-arn|Quetrupillán llafe}}) is the [[w:Passport|passport]] issued to [[Baliscan nationality law|citizens]] of [[Balisca]]. It enables the bearer to exit and re-enter Balisca freely; travel to and from other countries in accordance with [[Visa requirements for Baliscan citizens|visa requirements]]; facilitates the process of securing [[w:Consular assistance|assistance from Baliscan consular officials]] abroad, if necessary; and requests protection for the bearer while abroad.

